{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island \u2013 Origins</strong> is a prologue game to the upcoming <strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you\u2019ll find an island-building system: gather resources, construct houses, bridges, and even forts, experiment, and enjoy the atmosphere of creativity and the freedom of building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Origins</strong> is a single-player game with 10 missions where you gather resources, unlock new building elements, and develop your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Building\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chop down trees and break stones to collect materials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Resource gathering\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build houses, bridges, and even a fort to defend against pirates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Battles\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underwater world, and on the island encounter rabbits and deer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions give you goals to follow, but you can always keep building freely. Even after finishing all missions, continue expanding your island for pleasure: surf the waves, fly a kite, or sail a catamaran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Boat building\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Origins</strong> is a stand-alone game dedicated to creative island building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer\u2019s Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and supporting! Your support inspires me to keep going and brings the next chapter of <strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island</strong> closer \u2014 with thrilling online battles and exciting sea regattas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First tree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/e2fb8d31c22816f6c5b3c3ceaf393414332f3e30.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/3718fae4fd0bef7299b20fcedda5d463d3613088.jpg"},{"name":"First boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/abaf1828628810060b23a8f76d87c2dade85d926.jpg"},{"name":"Seafarer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/aa2091e8d8564412087b23ce74915b4909e4b12e.jpg"},{"name":"Story about","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/9cc27bd99b1b11bafd9e26e326a7c82c6b567c55.jpg"},{"name":"Cheat codes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/b1994b6feee5c9b6b137971692c08ebb91b9f306.jpg"},{"name":"Kite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/731127d342a83ae37bf8e7f311ac2ddbfff9b704.jpg"},{"name":"Crusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3971310/19287f29982aa744a9a18a2f12c89826814d7ab3.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971310?t=1758281182","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/36b012e30ba632dae67acfb2a7667da22cd0b160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758281182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/36b2bf9432ed3766a4ad084ad2712ca1a4400329/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758281182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/36b2bf9432ed3766a4ad084ad2712ca1a4400329/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758281182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island \u2013 Origins</strong> is a prologue game to the upcoming <strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you\u2019ll find an island-building system: gather resources, construct houses, bridges, and even forts, experiment, and enjoy the atmosphere of creativity and the freedom of building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Origins</strong> is a single-player game with 10 missions where you gather resources, unlock new building elements, and develop your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Building\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chop down trees and break stones to collect materials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Resource gathering\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build houses, bridges, and even a fort to defend against pirates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Battles\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underwater world, and on the island encounter rabbits and deer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions give you goals to follow, but you can always keep building freely. Even after finishing all missions, continue expanding your island for pleasure: surf the waves, fly a kite, or sail a catamaran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Boat building\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Origins</strong> is a stand-alone game dedicated to creative island building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer\u2019s Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and supporting! Your support inspires me to keep going and brings the next chapter of <strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island</strong> closer \u2014 with thrilling online battles and exciting sea regattas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Danilec"],"dlc":[3988860,3989300],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/c012ec2448e411e4c3de9670f93f98820093b4d0/header.jpg?t=1758281182","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3971310/1119